  "description": "Refurbishment and replacement of roof coverings to five existing canopies\r\rNew Code 4 lead cover flashings will be installed to all abutment back walls as required.\r\rThe existing timber fascias and soffits to all five canopies will be capped with white uPVC fascia and soffit boards, including appropriate matching trims, to provide a clean and durable finish.\r\rOne canopy, which has been recently removed, will be rebuilt to match the design, materials, and appearance of the existing canopies, and will receive the same scope of works as described above.\r\rAll associated works will be carried out, with all waste materials removed from site upon completion. The site will be left clean, tidy, and free of debris.",
